WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
Hey, is this seat taken?
嗨，这个座位有人吗？

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.650
No, go ahead.
没有，坐吧。

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:09.720
Thanks. Is this the room for the stochastic-processes class?
谢谢。这是随机过程课的教室吗？

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:14.460
I hope so. Otherwise, we’re both in the wrong place.
希望是。不然我们俩都走错地方了。

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.650
That would be a strong start to the semester.
那可真是个精彩的学期开始啊。（玩笑）

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:21.220
Exactly. I’m Camille, by the way.
就是啊。对了，我叫 Camille。

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:24.180
Nice to meet you. I’m Alex.
很高兴认识你。我叫 Alex。

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:28.550
Nice to meet you too. Are you in the El Karoui program?
我也很高兴认识你。你读的是 El Karoui 项目吗？
